    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），極珍稀（需同調）</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你進行對抗法術的豁免時，你可以用反應讓本次豁免具有優勢。此屬性一旦被使用，直到次日黎明前都無法被再次使用。<br />此外，穿着這套護甲期間，你可以用它施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.YYb9R08YduTPpE2s]{反魔法場 Antimagic Field}</em>，無需法術成分。此屬性一旦被使用，直到次日黎明前都無法被再次使用。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">該護甲主要由皮條固定的金屬護胸組成。儘管它並沒有爲四肢提供額外的防護，但其在保證着裝者活動自由度的同時，爲其生命器官提供了十分有效的保護效果。</span></p><p>While wearing this armor, you can use your reaction to give yourself advantage on a saving throw you make against a spell. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>In addition, while you wear this armor, you can use it to cast @spell[Antimagic Field], requiring no spell components. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>This armor consists of a fitted metal chest piece worn with supple leather. Although it leaves the legs and arms relatively unprotected, this armor provides good protection for the wearer's vital organs while leaving the wearer relatively unencumbered.</p></div>",
